Latin America: Brazil and Argentina see a resurgence of automotive parts production, creating steady demand for straightforward, cost‑effective networking solutions.
Middle East & Africa: Large‑scale petrochemical and infrastructure projects demand devices meeting MIL‑STD‑810 criteria, encouraging partnerships between global OEMs and regional integrators.
